OL,3,AAnthropic's blockbuster share listing -
OL,4,A5 surprising things we now know
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) firm
OL,7,FAnthropic just released the required
OL,8,Fpaperwork ahead of its long-anticipated
OL,9,Fdebut on the US stock market.
OL,11,FThe 335-page document included fresh
OL,12,Fdetails of how the Claude chatbot owner
OL,13,Fmakes money, what it spends that money
OL,14,Fon and who it is controlled by.
OL,16,FAnthropic also detailed some of the
OL,17,Frisks it claimed AI technology poses,
OL,18,Fincluding how it could take human
OL,19,Flives. That information sat alongside
OL,20,Fthe many purported benefits of the
OL,21,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
